; Shared names (scope lib), checked against the code in phase 6. The rest of the library: names/lib.map.
K0000 StackArea        ; 256-byte stack every program sets SP to the top of
K0100 CursorCol        ; text cursor column (0-39); CursorRow follows
K0101 CursorRow
K0102 WindDir          ; wind direction shown on the status line (WindUpdate)
K0103 RandState        ; 16 bytes added with carry by Random
K011A WindCount        ; steps until the wind may change (25)
K01A9 TileGfx          ; SHAPES.ULT: 80 tiles of 64 bytes
K15A9 CharGfx          ; CHARSET.ULT: 128 characters of 16 bytes
K25A9 ScreenSeg        ; segment of the CGA screen (B800)
K25AB PrintStrLen      ; print the NUL-ended string at SI, CX = its length
K25C1 PrintStr         ; print the NUL-ended string at SI at the cursor
K25C7 SwapCursor       ; exchange DX with the cursor (DL = column, DH = row)
K25CC PutChar          ; print AL at the cursor and advance (8 = backspace)
K2600 DrawChar         ; draw character AL at the cursor without moving it
K2670 DiskCheckStub    ; the copy protection's replacement: returns AL = 0 (0FFh in EXODUS)
K26C3 FillCell         ; store AX in the 8 scan lines of the cell at screen offset BX
K26E8 DrawTileBlock    ; draw AH rows x AL columns of tiles from the list at BX at screen DI
K2749 ClearScreen
K2773 ReadLine         ; read up to CX characters to ES:DI, with backspace; CX out = length
K27C1 Random           ; DL = random number below DH
K29AA KeyReady         ; ZF clear when a key is waiting
K29BD ReadKey          ; wait for a key: AH = scan code, AL = character
K2A18 PrintBcdWord     ; print AX as four BCD digits
K2A23 PrintBcdByte     ; print AL as two BCD digits
K2A3C PrintDigit       ; print the low nibble of AL as a hex digit
K2A4E ParseNumber      ; decimal number from the CX characters at SI
K2B4F ReadNumber       ; read a two-digit number (BCD in AL)
K2BF0 LoadFile         ; read the file named at DX, CX bytes, to BX (FCB at PSP:5C)
K2C7E PrintAt          ; print the string at SI at row DH, column DL
K2C87 SignStep         ; AL = -1, 0 or +1 by the sign of AL (a step towards a target)
K2CAA DrawView         ; draw the 11 x 11 tiles of ViewTiles in the map window
K2CC5 ViewTileAt       ; AL = the tile at view row BH, column BL
K2CEA WindUpdate       ; count down WindCount, choose a new WindDir, print it
K2D40 SoundOn          ; 0FFh: sounds play
K2D41 SoundTbl         ; the 12 sound routines, for codes 0F4h-0FFh
K2D59 Sound            ; play sound AL (0F4h-0FFh)
X0109 ViewTiles        ; the 11 x 11 tile list DrawView draws (EXODUS: the buffer at 24C4)
